4:player
72:Begins With a Step
73:???
74:Mm-hm...! That aura feels just right! This is great! You must be {var:player_nickname}!
75:Well, if there's nothing else, I gotta run!
76:Wait, wait, wait!
78:Who... are you?
80:Where to? To do what?
81:Chi Lin
82:Ahem...! I am Chi Lin, the Lady of the Horse Palace. I come to these lands bearing blessings...
83:Ughhh, the formal talk is wearing me out! Look, I'm a deity! I grant wishes and offer blessings!
84:I-is that so...
85:...Well, that's the plan, anyway. For some reason, wishes for smooth sailing at work are surprisingly popular this year...
86:I've already got a mountain of work to do...! At this rate, I'll never finish collecting all these wishes!
88:Uh... sure, but how exactly do we go about collecting wishes?
89:Well, there's really only one way to do it... I have to go visit everyone, door-to-door!
90:And as for the blessings, I'll just infuse my divine power into some food and hand it out! It's a big holiday, after all – nobody's gonna say no to delicious treats!
91:Wait... Chi Lin, are you really running out to collect these wishes all by yourself?!
92:(Meanwhile, a certain someone from before was basically waiting for tributes to be delivered right to her doorstep...)
93:Huh? What's the matter?
94:Let me get this straight...! Even though you did just claim to be a deity or whatever...
95:What? You don't think I look like one? Oh... Hahaha... Well, I'm not really good at the whole serious thing!
96:I just can't get the hang of Li Yang's style... But as you can see, I'm still the real deal!
97:I'm not saying I don't believe you...
98:All you need me to do is plan your routes?
99:Great!
100:Exactly!
101:But won't it be difficult... collecting everyone's wishes by yourself?
102:That's why I'm asking for your help! Hehe, and getting to help a deity out is pretty cool, huh?
103:A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step, as the saying goes. When it comes to work, if you can start it, you can finish it!
104:So, I'd better saddle up and get going! Later, {var:player_nickname}!
105:Wait...! Let me at least explain how traffic lights work first! Heyyy!
108:So... Could you help me? Please? Even if it's just planning my routes around One Han City!
